step Portals of the Legion
  tip Head east to Mannoroc Coven. Use the Rod of Banishing by each demon portal to close six of them.
  tip Careful: Infernals, Doomguards and Burning Blade Summoners walk close by many portals and may join in; kill nearby mobs first or drag the guardian away, for example toward the coven's central lake.
